- without group by  we get the answer for entire table
SELECT sum(amount) FROM orders 



- with groupby we get answer per each column
SELECT customer, sum(amount) FROM orders GROUP BY customer;


rule: 
- every column in select must be included in group by or be inside aggeration fucntion
ex: SELECT customer,status, SUM(amount) FROM order GROUP BY customer(this is wrong)
correct way: SELECT customer,status,SUM(amount) FROM order GROUP BY customer,status

